WEBVTT

00:05:28.491 --> 00:05:32.787
Or, “Five Times Hermione Snogged Harry --

00:05:32.787 --> 00:05:33.788
(Laughter)

00:05:34.372 --> 00:05:35.831
And One Time She Didn’t.”

00:05:36.123 --> 00:05:37.124
(Laughter)

00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:42.671
The sheer quantity of fanfiction
that’s been produced is astonishing.

00:05:42.922 --> 00:05:45.549
In the past 20 years alone,

00:05:45.549 --> 00:05:49.595
over 60 billion words of fanfiction
have been written

00:05:49.595 --> 00:05:52.681
and posted on a single online site:

00:05:52.681 --> 00:05:54.225
fanfiction.net,

00:05:54.225 --> 00:05:57.144
which is only one
of many fanfiction hubs.

00:05:57.561 --> 00:06:02.733
Now compare that with the amount
of fiction written in the English language